OL,3,GNEWSAThe cancer patient helping others
OL,4,Areturn to fitness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Sheffield has set up an
OL,7,Fexercise class to help other cancer
OL,8,Fpatients overcome the barriers to
OL,9,Fregaining their fitness.
OL,11,FJoanne Graham was diagnosed with breast
OL,12,Fcancer in 2024 and, following a
OL,13,Fmastectomy and reconstructive surgery,
OL,14,Falso had her ovaries removed. She
OL,15,Fstruggled to find a fitness class that
OL,16,Fshe felt comfortable with.
OL,18,FBacked by the Weston Park Cancer
OL,19,FCharity, the 51-year-old fitness
OL,20,Finstructor started her own sessions for
OL,21,Fpatients at the Zest Community Centre
OL,22,Fin Upperthorpe.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
